# Normalise everything to LF in the repository.
#
# This project is built on Linux (GitHub Actions). A Gradle wrapper committed
# with CRLF fails there outright -- "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter" -- and the
# release AAB never gets produced. Windows checkouts keep working fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.ttf binary
